  "description": "Scan, read QR Code, barcodes from PDF file in web browser in ASP.NET web app: This package includes C# sample source code to edit PDF in web browser and scan, read QR Code, barcodes from PDF file in ASP.NET web app.\n\nEdgePDF - Online PDF editor for ASP.NET Core web app :\n * Generate PDFs from MS Word, Excel, PowerPoint, TIFF, JPG, PNG and many image formats\n * Convert PDF to Word, multi-page TIFF, SVG, JPG, PNG and other image formats\n * Read, extract text, image, font data, AcroForm data from PDFs\n * Edit, modify existing PDF text, image, bookmark, metadata contents\n * Add, generate, read QR Code and barcode on PDF\n * Convert scanned PDF to editable PDF using OCR\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Guides :\n* Developer Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/csharp-imaging/pdf-html5/\n* Support : support@rasteredge.com",
